ui-the-baseline-bottom-app-bar-uses-an-80dp-container-with-48dp-action-targets-a-4dp-leading = The baseline bottom app bar uses an 80dp container with 48dp action targets, a 4dp leading inset, and a 56dp FAB 12dp from the top and 16dp from the trailing edge. The container figure above shows these padding and size measurements.

ui-use-a-toolbar-to-provide-actions-related-to-the-current-page-toolbars-can-contain-many-act = Use a toolbar to provide actions related to the current page. Toolbars can contain many actions and can scale to show more actions in larger windows.

