ui-docked-toolbar-spans-the-full-width-of-the-window-it-s-best-used-for-global-actions-that-r = Docked toolbar: Spans the full width of the window. It's best used for global actions that remain the same across multiple pages.

ui-floating-toolbar-floats-above-the-body-content-it-s-best-used-for-contextual-actions-relev = Floating toolbar: Floats above the body content. It's best used for contextual actions relevant to the body content or the specific page.

