ui-when-tapping-on-an-icon-button-in-the-toolbar-a-touch-ripple-appears-indicating-interactio = When tapping on an icon button in the toolbar, a touch ripple appears, indicating interaction feedback.

ui-when-hovered-the-hover-state-provides-a-visual-cue-to-the-user-that-the-element-is-interac-6431 = When hovered, the hover state provides a visual cue to the user that the element is interactive. When clicked (in both active and inactive states), a ripple appears, showing the user feedback.

ui-focus-lands-on-the-first-interactive-element-use-tab-to-navigate-through-all-other-actions = Focus lands on the first interactive element. Use Tab to navigate through all other actions, and Space or Enter to activate them. Try it on the toolbar below.

