ui-on-web-the-toolbar-container-should-have-the-toolbar-role-on-mobile-it-can-be-a-generic-co = On web, the toolbar container should have the toolbar role. On mobile, it can be a generic container. All actions inside the toolbar should follow their respective accessibility guidelines.

ui-tessera-exposes-the-toolbar-role-on-the-container-labels-it-and-labels-each-action-toggle = Tessera exposes the toolbar role on the container, labels it, and labels each action. Toggle actions also publish their toggled state.

